      <dependency task="135" status="pending">C1: CIAM is routed through the same veto/suppression pipeline as the workforce contact plane. Without it, Limited and Restricted cannot be made real on CIAM from this task's single change point. Re-derive 135's status from its own POML.</dependency>
      <dependency task="131" status="pending">C3: the grant cache drops DirectAccessLevel, so on a cache HIT a direct grant on a Secure (and, after this task, Limited) root reads as None. That fails closed, but it makes Limited's "direct grants count" intermittently false. Task 135 already depends on 131, so this is satisfied transitively; see escalation trigger 2.</dependency>
